{
  "key": "letter-335-part-01",
  "number": 335,
  "generationId": "01a1e912-12d7-701f-a14f-6150a956239e",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.712041
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Meditation is beyond knowledge.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.099342,
      "end": 4.0538549999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "You can be it but you cannot know it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.301565,
      "end": 7.751293
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "All knowledge is superficial.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/04.mp3",
      "start": 9.081927,
      "end": 10.938593999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It is never anything else but an acquaintance from outside.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/05.mp3",
      "start": 12.224921,
      "end": 15.139840999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It is always about but never the thing itself,",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/06.mp3",
      "start": 16.456463,
      "end": 18.904626
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "When the Chinese emperor Wu came to meet Bodhidharma he asked the master: What is the holy, ultimate truth?",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/07.mp3",
      "start": 20.1739,
      "end": 27.111338
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Bodhidharma laughed and replied: Nothing holy, sir, and it is emptiness itself.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/08.mp3",
      "start": 28.604898,
      "end": 34.29712
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Of course Wu was taken aback, but he asked again: Then who is the one who at present stands confronting me?",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/09.mp3",
      "start": 35.917302,
      "end": 42.850044999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Bodhidharma simply said: I don't know.",
      "path": "audio/1971-335/10.mp3",
      "start": 44.392381,
      "end": 48.33
    }
  ]
}
